ential pitfalls, we can ensure that our path is illuminated by the light of knowledge, rather than shrouded in the darkness of ignorance, and that we are able to navigate the complexities of the world with confidence, like walking in the warm light of the sun, on a course that is truly mine, and not dictated by the influence of a stranger. <<Media Literacy in the Digital Age>>", "logprobs": [{"token": "Hand", "logprob": -0.04860015958547592}, {"token": " in", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " hand", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " with", "logprob": -0.0019286142196506262}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.00025781645672395825}, {"token": " latest", "logprob": -0.061138689517974854}, {"token": " developments", "logprob": -0.015181000344455242}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.1602240949869156}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.011714831925928593}, {"token": " media", "logprob": -0.05795402452349663}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.03303594887256622}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.04478542134165764}, {"token": " new", "logprob": -0.0003524397616274655}, {"token": " course", "logprob": -0.007648824248462915}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.06536480039358139}, {"token": " action", "logprob": -0.0298132486641407}, {"token": " has", "logprob": -0.014164624735713005}, {"token": " been", "logprob": -0.002480051713064313}, {"token": " taken", "logprob": -0.606630265712738}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.00015841660206206143}, {"token": " address", "logprob": -0.26777952909469604}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.0004962643142789602}, {"token": " concerns", "logprob": -0.23422975838184357}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -3.576272320060525e-06}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.005687838885933161}, {"token": " public", "logprob": -0.057000719010829926}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -5.304672595229931e-05}, {"token": " The", "logprob": -0.006809718441218138}, {"token": " article", "logprob": -1.2916364669799805}, {"token": " highlights", "logprob": -0.5747063159942627}, {"token": " the", "logpro